      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEDGE TAIL EAGLE (5) finished fourth at Ballarat two runs back then performed admirably last time out, making up plenty of ground in a sustained effort but just missing out over 1710m at Ballarat. Meets a comparable field and he can take this out. OVER HERE (9) ran fifth last start at Kilmore over 1690m, beaten 17 metres. Has ability and should be right in the finish. GYM QUEEN (11) should be ready to peak now after finishing fourth over 1690m at Kilmore a week-and-a-half ago. Expect her to give this a real shake. LEZAMA (1) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when she broke and finished 30 metres away in seventh over 1710m at Ballarat. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Meets a similar line up so if she behaves a big run is likely.",
